OL,3,GNEWSAMum who died rescuing son in
OL,4,ABahamas was hero, husband says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe husband of a British woman who died
OL,7,Frescuing their son when they were swept
OL,8,Faway while snorkelling in the Bahamas
OL,9,Fsays she was a "hero... in life and in
OL,10,Fdeath".
OL,12,FLeanne Gregory, from Stapleford in
OL,13,FNottinghamshire, was swept away in a
OL,14,Fstrong current, police said, before her
OL,15,Fchildren were then rescued from the
OL,16,Fwater on the island of Bimini on
OL,17,FTuesday.
OL,19,FNathan Gregory said the loss of his
OL,20,F36-year-old "childhood sweetheart" was
OL,21,F"unimaginable for our family".
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
